Hi Dora,

A couple of issues have been addressed in the development version of GGIR on GitHub. Yesterday I submitted a new GGIR version (2.2-0) to CRAN, which includes these fixes. CRAN approved it and it should become installable in the upcoming days. So, I think it is best if you could try again with the new GGIR version.

For part 5 MM report the column calendar_date should be a logical sequence of days corresponding to the days listed in the column weekday. It is possible that a day is skipped, but a double day should not happen.

